## PR Title
Allow br_arb_fixed to support a single requester

## PR Description
Removes the `NumRequesters >= 2` restriction so that `br_arb_fixed` and its internal implementation work correctly when `NumRequesters == 1`. Updates the fixed-priority FPV monitors to handle single-requester pass-through scenarios and generalises `arb_basic_fpv_monitor` so other downstream arbiters can re-use the same flexibility. Fixes issue #762.

